{"t":"Kha'zeel","s":"kha-zeel-7c67e","k":"local","i":"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png","q":3,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div style=\"float: right;\"><div class=\"minimap mobile-hidden minimap-zoom-1\" style=\"overflow:hidden;display: inline-block;\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden; border: #3366CC 1px solid; position:relative; display: block;image-rendering: crisp-edges;image-rendering: optimizeSpeed;image-rendering: -moz-crisp-edges;image-rendering: -webkit-optimize-contrast;image-rendering: pixelated;-ms-interpolation-mode: nearest-neighbor;width: 256px; height: 256px;\">\n<div class=\"map_image_crop mobile-hidden\" style=\"overflow:hidden; position:absolute; top: -1573px;left:-1159px;clip:rect(1573px 1415px 1829px 1159px);\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Minimap Floor 7\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"2048\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Minimap_Floor_7_10ea82.png\" width=\"2560\"/></span></span>\n<p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p><p><br/>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:256px;width:128px;left:0px;top:0px;border-right:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div><div style=\"position:absolute;display:block;height:128px;width:256px;left:0px;top:0px;border-bottom:1px dashed #FFFFFF;\"></div>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:right;background-color:#DDDDDD;padding:0px 3px;\"><div class=\"minimap_clic\"><a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33031,32677,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">Browse Map (33031, 32677, 7)</a><div class=\"minimap_wp minimap_w\"></div></div></div></div></div>\n<p><i>For the Cyclopedia Map Subarea, click <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Mountains\">here</a>.</i>\n</p><p>Kha'zeel is the mountain range separating the <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27labal\">Kha'labal</a>, the desert surrounding <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a>, from <a href=\"#/wiki/Tiquanda\">Tiquanda</a>, the jungle surrounding <a href=\"#/wiki/Port%20Hope\">Port Hope</a>, and the <a href=\"#/wiki/Devourer%20%28Geography%29\">Devourer</a>, the desert surrounding <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>. This mountain range has many caves and entrances, but very few passages through. You can cross it by the above ground <a href=\"#/wiki/Kha%27zeel%20Pass\">Kha'zeel Pass</a> or the underground <a href=\"#/wiki/Darama%20Terramite%20Cave\">Darama Terramite Cave</a>.\n</p><p>The Kha'labal side of the mountain range is home to many <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon\">Dragons</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Dragon%20Lord\">Dragon Lords</a>, in addition to various other creatures such as <a href=\"#/wiki/Hyaena\">Hyaenas</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Scorpion\">Scorpions</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Cobra\">Cobras</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golems</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Energy%20Elemental\">Energy Elementals</a>. This side is also where the feuding Djinns have built their fortresses, the <a href=\"#/wiki/Ashta%27daramai\">Ashta'daramai</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Blue%20Djinn\">Blue Djinns</a>) and <a href=\"#/wiki/Mal%27ouquah\">Mal'ouquah</a> (<a href=\"#/wiki/Green%20Djinn\">Green Djinns</a>).\n</p><p>The Tiquanda side of the mountain range is home to <a href=\"#/wiki/Hydra\">Hydras</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Golem\">Stone Golems</a>, and a few <a href=\"#/wiki/Wyvern\">Wyverns</a> at the southern end. <a href=\"#/wiki/Dwarves\">Dwarves</a> have also mined a base just under the mountain.\n</p><p>They are called <i>Deathwish Mountains</i> by <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Orc%20King\">The Orc King</a>.\n</p></div>","quests":["spirit-grounds-mini-world-change","the-great-dragon-hunt-quest","waterfall-quest"]}